\textbf{while} (\textit{count} $< n-1$) \textbf{do}

\hspace{1em} get next edge $(\textit{v}, \textit{w})$

\hspace{1em} \textbf{if} ($\operatorname{component}(\textit{v}) \neq \operatorname{component}(\textit{w})$)

